    {
      "title": "API Styles: REST vs gRPC vs GraphQL",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 0,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "API Styles: REST vs gRPC vs GraphQL",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. REST",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "URLs **identify** resources: `/users/42`",
                "Verbs **manipulate** them: `GET` reads, `POST` creates",
                "`PUT` replaces, `PATCH` changes part, `DELETE` removes",
                "==Idempotent== = repeat has same effect as once",
                "GET, PUT, DELETE yes; POST no",
                "GET is also ==safe==",
                "Stateless",
                "JSON over HTTP",
                "Cacheable via HTTP"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. gRPC and GraphQL",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Contract-first== Protobuf over HTTP/2",
                "Binary, strongly typed",
                "Unary, server, client, bidirectional streaming",
                "Best for internal calls"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Single endpoint; schema: queries, mutations, subscriptions",
                "Fixes over- and under-fetching",
                "N+1: 20 users, 20 order lookups = 1+20 queries; ==DataLoader== batches them into one",
                "Query names exact fields"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "graphql",
              "lines": [
                "query {",
                "  user(id: 42) {",
                "    name",
                "    orders { id }",
                "  }",
                "}"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Choosing",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
                "REST",
                "gRPC",
                "GraphQL"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Best for",
                  "Public",
                  "Internal",
                  "Many clients"
                ],
                [
                  "Plus",
                  "Simple, cacheable",
                  "Fastest, streaming",
                  "Flexible"
                ],
                [
                  "Minus",
                  "Over-fetching",
                  "Needs HTTP/2, grpc-web",
                  "Hard to cache"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flowchart",
              "spec": {
                "rows": [
                  [
                    "q"
                  ],
                  [
                    "a",
                    "b",
                    "c"
                  ]
                ],
                "nodes": {
                  "q": {
                    "text": "Who calls?",
                    "shape": "diamond"
                  },
                  "a": {
                    "text": "REST",
                    "shape": "box",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  "b": {
                    "text": "gRPC",
                    "shape": "box",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  "c": {
                    "text": "GraphQL",
                    "shape": "box",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  }
                },
                "edges": [
                  {
                    "from": "q",
                    "to": "a",
                    "label": "public"
                  },
                  {
                    "from": "q",
                    "to": "b",
                    "label": "internal"
                  },
                  {
                    "from": "q",
                    "to": "c",
                    "label": "many shapes"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Hype",
              "text": "Never pick GraphQL or gRPC by hype. Default to ==REST== publicly."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "REST Design: Naming, Pagination, Versioning, Idempotency",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 1,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "REST Design: Naming, Pagination, Versioning, Idempotency",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Resource Naming",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Rule",
                "Do",
                "Don't"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Plural nouns",
                  "`GET /users/42/orders`",
                  "`/getOrder`"
                ],
                [
                  "Create",
                  "`POST /orders`",
                  "`/createOrder`"
                ],
                [
                  "Case",
                  "lowercase kebab-case",
                  "camelCase"
                ],
                [
                  "Non-CRUD action",
                  "`POST /orders/42/cancel`",
                  "`/cancelOrder`"
                ]
              ],
              "frame": "dashed"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Pagination",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
                "Offset",
                "Cursor"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Query",
                  "`?limit=20&offset=40`",
                  "`?limit=20&cursor=`opaque token"
                ],
                [
                  "Pro",
                  "simple, jump to a page",
                  "stable on inserts, fast with index"
                ],
                [
                  "Con",
                  "slow deep offsets, skips or duplicates rows",
                  "no random page jump"
                ],
                [
                  "Detail",
                  "DB scans and discards rows",
                  "`WHERE id > last ORDER BY id`; return `next_cursor`"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Versioning",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Path `/v1/users`: most common, explicit",
                "Or header `Accept: application/vnd.api.v2+json`, or query param",
                "Bump major only for ==breaking== changes",
                "Adding optional fields is non-breaking",
                "Announce deprecation with a `Sunset` header"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "4. Idempotency Keys",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Client",
                    "sub": "`Idempotency-Key: <uuid>`",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Server",
                    "sub": "stores key + first response",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Retry",
                    "sub": "same key, replayed response",
                    "ink": "green"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "GET, PUT, DELETE are idempotent; ==POST is not==",
                "Keys expire after ~**24h**",
                "Same key, different body: {red:422}"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Retries",
              "text": "Same key replays the stored response: a network retry never double-charges."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "API Gateway and Backend-for-Frontend",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 2,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "API Gateway and Backend-for-Frontend",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. API Gateway",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Single entry point== in front of microservices",
                "Routing, {blue:TLS termination}, authentication",
                "Rate limiting, caching, logging",
                "Request/response transformation",
                "Centralises **cross-cutting concerns**, so no service reimplements them"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Client",
                    "ink": "black"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Gateway",
                    "sub": "authenticate, rate limit, route",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Service",
                    "sub": "domain rules",
                    "ink": "green"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. BFF vs Gateway",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==BFF== = one tailored backend per client type: web, mobile, partner",
                "Aggregates and reshapes downstream calls",
                "Mobile gets a {green:lean} payload, web gets a {purple:rich} one"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
                "Gateway",
                "BFF"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Count",
                  "Shared, one per system",
                  "One per client"
                ],
                [
                  "Owner",
                  "Shared by all teams",
                  "Frontend team"
                ],
                [
                  "Job",
                  "Cross-cutting policy",
                  "Aggregation and shaping"
                ]
              ],
              "highlightRow": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Common Mistake",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "No business logic in the gateway",
              "text": "It becomes a **single point of failure** and a team bottleneck."
            },
            {
              "type": "sidebox",
              "title": "Keep the gateway healthy",
              "items": [
                "Keep it ==thin==",
                "Run it ==redundant==",
                "Domain rules stay in the services"
              ],
              "ink": "red"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Authentication vs Authorization, OAuth 2.0 and JWT",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 3,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Authentication vs Authorization, OAuth 2.0 and JWT",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Authn vs Authz",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
                "Authn",
                "Authz"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Asks",
                  "Who are you?",
                  "What may you do?"
                ],
                [
                  "Fails",
                  "{red:401} bad or no credentials",
                  "{red:403} known user, denied"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. OAuth 2.0 and Flows",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Delegated authorization==, not authentication",
                "Roles: resource owner, client, auth server, resource server",
                "Client gets a **scoped access token**, never the password",
                "**OIDC** adds an ID token for authentication"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Redirect",
                    "sub": "to auth server",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Code",
                    "sub": "back to client",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Exchange",
                    "sub": "code + code_verifier",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Tokens",
                    "sub": "access + refresh",
                    "ink": "green"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Auth Code + PKCE==: web, SPA, mobile",
                "==Client Credentials==: machine-to-machine",
                "Implicit flow: {red:deprecated}"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. JWT and Mistakes",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`header.payload.signature`, each base64url",
                "Claims: `sub` `iss` `aud` `exp` `scope`",
                "Signature: HS256 shared secret, or RS256/ES256 key pair",
                "Payload is signed, ==NOT encrypted==: no secrets"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "python",
              "lines": [
                "jwt.decode(token, key,",
                "  algorithms=[\"RS256\"],",
                "  audience=\"api\", issuer=ISS)"
              ],
              "note": "pin alg; checks exp, aud, iss"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Accepting `alg: none`, or not pinning the algorithm",
                "Skipping `exp`, `iss`, `aud` checks",
                "Tokens in localStorage (XSS)",
                "Long-lived access token: use **5-15 min** plus rotating refresh token"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "ink": "red"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Edge Rate Limiting",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 4,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Edge Rate Limiting",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Limit at the Edge",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "CDN, WAF or ==gateway== rejects abuse before it hits the **origin**",
                "Answer {red:429 Too Many Requests}",
                "`Retry-After` tells the client when to return"
              ],
              "style": "check",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "http",
              "lines": [
                "HTTP/1.1 429 Too Many Requests",
                "Retry-After: 30",
                "X-RateLimit-Limit: 100",
                "X-RateLimit-Remaining: 0"
              ],
              "note": "limit headers on the rejection"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Algorithms",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Token bucket==: N tokens, refilled at a fixed rate, one spent per request",
                "Allows bursts up to N, holds the average rate",
                "The most common choice"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Algorithm",
                "Behaviour",
                "Catch"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Fixed window",
                  "Counter per window",
                  "**Double burst** at the boundary"
                ],
                [
                  "Sliding window",
                  "Log or counter, smooth",
                  "More memory"
                ],
                [
                  "Leaky bucket",
                  "Constant output rate",
                  "No bursts"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Key and Mistakes",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Authenticated: key by ==API key== or user",
                "Anonymous: key by IP (shared NAT punishes many users)",
                "Keep counters in ==Redis== so every gateway instance agrees"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Mistakes",
              "text": "Limiting only in the app: the origin still **pays**. Retrying at once on 429: use ==exponential backoff with jitter==."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "API Design Cheat Sheet",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 5,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "API Design Cheat Sheet",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Design the API",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Style",
                "Pick for"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "REST",
                  "public, cacheable"
                ],
                [
                  "gRPC",
                  "internal, streaming"
                ],
                [
                  "GraphQL",
                  "many clients, varying data"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Plural nouns==, no verbs, nest for ownership: `/users/42/orders`",
                "Offset: simple but ==drifts==; cursor: ==stable and fast==",
                "Version in path `/v1`; bump only on ==breaking changes=="
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Retries and status codes",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`Idempotency-Key` header on ==POST==",
                "Server ==replays the stored response== on retry"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Code",
                "Meaning"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "401",
                  "unauthenticated"
                ],
                [
                  "403",
                  "forbidden"
                ],
                [
                  "429",
                  "rate limited"
                ],
                [
                  "422",
                  "key reused, different body"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Auth and edge",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==OAuth 2.0== = delegated authorization; ==OIDC== = identity",
                "Users: ==Auth Code + PKCE==; services: ==Client Credentials==",
                "JWT = ==signed, not encrypted==; validate `alg`, `exp`, `iss`, `aud`"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Client",
                    "sub": "backoff + jitter",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Gateway",
                    "sub": "cross-cutting policy",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Token bucket",
                    "sub": "keyed by API key",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "BFF",
                    "sub": "per client type",
                    "ink": "green"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Over the limit",
              "text": "Answer ==429 + Retry-After==."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Check yourself",
      "role": "quiz",
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Check yourself",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "qa",
              "q": "A client fetches page 2 with `?limit=20&offset=20`. Meanwhile 5 new rows are inserted at the top of the list. What does page 2 show?",
              "a_bullets": [
                "The last 5 rows of page 1 appear again, as duplicates",
                "Offsets count positions, and the insert shifted them",
                "Fix: cursor pagination on the last seen id"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "qa",
              "q": "A JWT is signed with RS256 and its payload holds the claim `ssn`. Is the ssn safe from the client?",
              "a_bullets": [
                "No: the payload is only base64url encoded, so anyone can decode it",
                "The signature proves integrity, not secrecy"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "qa",
              "q": "POST /payments times out. The client retries with the same Idempotency-Key and the same body. How many charges happen?",
              "a_bullets": [
                "One: the server replays the stored first response",
                "Same key with a different body returns 422"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}